# Intentionally credential-free: this is a public repository.
#
# The `beta` lane reads App Store Connect credentials from the environment:
#   ASC_KEY_ID       — App Store Connect API key id
#   ASC_ISSUER_ID    — issuer id
#   ASC_KEY_CONTENT  — base64-encoded contents of the .p8 private key
#
# No Apple ID, team id, or bundle identifier is committed here.
